{"meta":{"ui":"expenses","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"I have four expenses from one report waiting for my approval: Delta Air Lines, Travel, Nov 3, $412.60; Blue Bottle Coffee, Meals, Nov 4, $18.40; Uber, Transport, Nov 5, $36.25 (no receipt attached); WeWork day pass, Office, Nov 6, $45.00. Show them in a card with merchant, category, date and amount, flag the one missing a receipt, and let me approve or reject each (changing my mind is fine). Show how many are approved (\"N of 4 approved\") and the approved total, and a Submit button; after I submit, the card says Submitted with the count and the total.","text":"state exps=[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"merchant\":\"Delta Air Lines\",\"category\":\"Travel\",\"date\":\"Nov 3\",\"amount\":412.60,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":\"e2\",\"merchant\":\"Blue Bottle Coffee\",\"category\":\"Meals\",\"date\":\"Nov 4\",\"amount\":18.40,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":\"e3\",\"merchant\":\"Uber\",\"category\":\"Transport\",\"date\":\"Nov 5\",\"amount\":36.25,\"receipt\":false,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":\"e4\",\"merchant\":\"WeWork day pass\",\"category\":\"Office\",\"date\":\"Nov 6\",\"amount\":45.00,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"}]\nstate submitted=false\nlet approved = length(filter(exps, x => x.status == \"approved\"))\nlet total = sum(filter(exps, x => x.status == \"approved\"), x => x.amount)\nChatCard \"Expense report\" \"4 expenses awaiting approval\" icon:\"receipt_long\" status:\"Pending\" w:390\n  if !submitted\n    each e in exps\n      Box fill:#FFF8FAFC radius:10 pad:12\n        Column gap:8\n          Row between\n            Column gap:2\n              Text.strong \"{e.merchant}\"\n              Text.muted \"{e.category} · {e.date}\"\n            Text.strong \"{money(e.amount,\"$\",2)}\"\n          if !e.receipt\n            Callout \"No receipt attached\" \"Attach a receipt before approving this expense.\" tone:warn icon:\"warning\"\n          Row gap:8\n            ChoiceChip \"Approve\" selected:{e.status == \"approved\"} -> e.status=\"approved\"\n            ChoiceChip \"Reject\" selected:{e.status == \"rejected\"} -> e.status=\"rejected\"\n    Text.strong \"{approved} of 4 approved\"\n    TotalBar \"Approved total\" \"Pending review\" amount:=total cta:\"Submit\" enabled:{approved > 0} -> submitted=true\n  if submitted\n    Receipt \"Submitted\" \"{approved} expenses submitted for {money(total,\"$\",2)} in total.\" tone:good icon:\"check_circle\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9486,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":727,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":520,"totalMs":3087}}
